+# Contributing
+
+Thanks for your interest in test-calculator.
+
+## AI policy
+
+This project does not accept contributions that were written, in whole or in part, by AI tools or
+autonomous agents. Pull requests must be written by a human who can explain every line of the change.
+Automated or agent-generated pull requests will be closed without review.
